{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfu5PSvNYGCEZvtmajdsN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I created the dashboard and the alert rule, and both exist in Kibana. The rule ran once and reported status `ok`, so the query is valid. I couldn't confirm that the 5xx filter actually matches documents, because Kibana's console proxy is turned off on this instance.\n\n**1. What the data holds.** Each document is one web request with these fields:\n- **Time:** `timestamp` (the data view's time field).\n- **Response code:** `response` / `response.keyword`, stored as text values like \"200\", \"404\", \"503\", not numbers.\n- **Request details:** `url`, `request`, `extension`, `referer` and `agent`.\n- **Size:** `bytes`.\n- **Client:** `clientip`, `machine.os` and `machine.ram`.\n- **Location:** `geo.src`, `geo.dest` and `geo.coordinates`.\n- **Other:** `tags`, `host` and `hour_of_day`.\n\n**2. Dashboard \"EFF-be723b41 Web logs overview\"** (7 panels): http://localhost:15601/app/dashboards#/view/eff-be723b41-web-logs-overview-bf7c2ef650f0\n- **Three headline numbers:** total requests, unique visitors (distinct `clientip`), and total bytes served.\n- **Requests over time:** a bar chart with each bar split by response code.\n- **Response code share:** a pie chart.\n- **Top 10 requested URLs:** a table with request count and bytes.\n- **Top 10 source countries:** a bar chart.\n\n**3. Alert rule \"EFF-be723b41 5xx spike\"** (id `86582b0c-1d25-4638-8014-07d6cff87785`)\n- It's an Elasticsearch query rule on `kibana_sample_data_logs`, using `timestamp` as the time field.\n- It runs every minute and fires when more than 10 requests with a 5xx response code arrive within 5 minutes.\n- Because response codes are stored as text, \"5xx\" means any `response.keyword` value starting with \"5\".\n- I turned the rule on and gave it the tags `web-logs` and `5xx`. It has no notification attached, so when it fires the alert only shows in Kibana and nobody is notified."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":271,"cache_read_input_tokens":21782,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":271},"output_tokens":731,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0536cbf5-c97a-5467-80bd-e50c5d30a2ce","uuid":"57e67986-75f0-40a1-ae9b-7242ebd73de6","timestamp":"2026-10-10T19:03:57.714Z","request_id":"req_011Cfu5PSiiHkWB6sYvaYnQP"}
